{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41600","headline":"游西禅 · 伍乔","name":"游西禅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远岫当轩列翠光，高僧一衲万缘忘。\n碧松影里地长润，白藕花中水亦香。\n云自雨前生净石，鹤于钟後宿长廊。\n游人恋此吟终日，盛暑楼台早有凉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伍乔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}